              "type": "method",
              "name": "openAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 2/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>options</strong> {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} - 打开选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a>&lt;<a href=\"epubBookType\">EpubBook</a>&gt; }</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">epub.openAsync(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;).then((book) =&gt; {\n    console.log(book.positions);\n    book.close();\n}).catch(e =&gt; console.error(e.toString()));\n</code></pre>\n",
