              "textRaw": "epub.metadata(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "metadata",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 文件路径或打开选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a> } - 元数据对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开书籍, 读取元数据后关闭. 返回对象的字段见 <a href=\"epubBookType#p-metadata\">EpubBook#metadata</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let meta = epub.metadata(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;);\nconsole.log(meta.title, meta.language, meta.positions);\n</code></pre>\n",
