          "name": "[m]_toc",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "epub.toc(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "toc",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 文件路径或打开选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a>[] } - 目录树</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开书籍, 读取目录后关闭. 目录是 <code>{ title, href, children }</code> 节点组成的树, 见 <a href=\"epubBookType#p-toc\">EpubBook#toc</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">function print(entries, depth) {\n    entries.forEach((e) =&gt; {\n        console.log(&#39;  &#39;.repeat(depth) + e.title, e.href);\n        print(e.children, depth + 1);\n    });\n}\nprint(epub.toc(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;), 0);\n</code></pre>\n",
