              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 文件路径或打开选项</li>\n<li><strong>[ target ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | {{ href: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 资源 href, 阅读顺序索引, 或带 <code>href</code> 的对象 (目录项, 阅读顺序项或 <a href=\"epubLocatorType\">EpubLocator</a>); 省略时为全书</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li>offset?: <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a>;</li>\n<li>maxChars?: <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a>;</li>\n<li>format?: <code>&#39;text&#39;</code> | <code>&#39;markdown&#39;</code>;</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}} - 提取选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 文本</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开书籍, 提取文本后关闭. 参数与结果同 <a href=\"epubBookType#m-text\">EpubBook#text</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let first = epub.text(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;, 0, { maxChars: 2000 });\nlet whole = epub.text(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;);\n</code></pre>\n",
