        {
          "textRaw": "[m] cover",
          "name": "[m]_cover",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "epub.cover(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "cover",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 1/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 文件路径或打开选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"imageWrapperType\">ImageWrapper</a> } - 封面图像</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开书籍, 解码封面后关闭. 书籍没有封面资源时抛出 <code>RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND</code>, 封面无法解码时抛出 <code>PARSE_FAILED</code>. 返回的图像使用完毕后应调用其 <code>recycle()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let cover = epub.cover(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;);\nconsole.log(cover.getWidth(), cover.getHeight());\ncover.recycle();\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
