        {
          "textRaw": "[m] annotations",
          "name": "[m]_annotations",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "epub.annotations(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "annotations",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | {{ path: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; displayName?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }} } - 文件路径或打开选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> {{ id: <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a>; style: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; color: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; note?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; quote?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; title?: <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>; locator: <a href=\"epubLocatorType\">EpubLocator</a>; createdAt: <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a>; updatedAt: <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }}[] - 高亮与笔记列表</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开书籍, 读取阅读器为它保存的高亮与笔记后关闭. 结果同 <a href=\"epubBookType#m-annotations\">EpubBook#annotations</a>: 按阅读顺序排列, 最多 2000 条. 需要 Readium EPUB Reader 插件 1.1.0 (EPUB 契约版本 2) 与携带该契约版本的 AutoJs6 构建 (6.8.0 build 5282 之后); 插件为 1.0.0 时失败于 <code>PLUGIN_INCOMPATIBLE</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">epub.annotations(&#39;./books/moby-dick.epub&#39;)\n    .forEach(a =&gt; console.log(a.title || a.locator.href, &#39;|&#39;, a.quote, a.note ? &#39;// &#39; + a.note : &#39;&#39;));\n</code></pre>\n",
