        {
          "textRaw": "[m] isAvailable",
          "name": "[m]_isavailable",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "epub.isAvailable()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "isAvailable",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否有兼容且已启用的 EPUB 插件</li>\n</ul>\n<p>探测插件. 插件缺失, 被禁用或不兼容时返回 <code>false</code>, 不抛出异常.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">if (!epub.isAvailable()) {\n    toastLog(&#39;请在插件中心安装并启用 Readium EPUB Reader&#39;);\n    exit();\n}\n</code></pre>\n",
